{'symbol': 'AEE', 'date': '2021-05-10 17:09:00', 'title': 'AMEREN ANNOUNCES FIRST QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': "ST. LOUIS, MAY 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AMEREN CORPORATION (NYSE: AEE) TODAY ANNOUNCED FIRST QUARTER 2021 NET INCOME ATTRIBUTABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $233 MILLION, OR $0.91 PER DILUTED SHARE, COMPARED TO FIRST QUARTER 2020 NET INCOME ATTRIBUTABLE TO COMMON SHAREHOLDERS OF $146 MILLION, OR $0.59 PER DILUTED SHARE. FIRST QUARTER 2021 RESULTS REFLECTED EARNINGS ON INCREASED INFRASTRUCTURE INVESTMENTS MADE ACROSS ALL BUSINESS SEGMENTS DRIVEN BY SOLID EXECUTION OF THE COMPANY'S STRATEGY."}